## State machine

::diagram[type=state title="Order lifecycle"]
[*] -> Cart
Cart -> Checkout: submit
Checkout -> Paid: pay
Checkout -> Cart: edit
Paid -> Shipped: fulfill
Shipped -> [*]
::

